Name "ISP Business"
Author "Deathskills + Claude"
Description "Run your own Internet Service Provider. Switch server groups to ISP mode: Towers carry 15 Gbps, Racks 50 Gbps and Big Racks 250 Gbps, with much lower power per Mbps. Your company's own internet then runs through your ISP, so you pay wholesale transit instead of the vanilla ISP rate. Works in multiplayer. Requires 0HarmonyLoader. AI products and companies offer you ISP deals in the Deals window that pay per Mbps delivered. Deals with cities and other players come in later versions."
